THIRD-PARTY COLOUR DATA
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO colour-library data.

The script `inkscape-print-libraries.sh` downloads, only when the user
runs it, the following works and installs them unmodified into the
user's Inkscape profile:

  * HLC Colour Atlas
    (c) freieFarbe e.V.
    Licence: CC BY-ND 4.0
    https://www.freiefarbe.de/en/thema-farbe/hlc-colour-atlas/

  * Open Colour Systems Collection 2.0
    (c) dtp studio oldenburg
    Licence: CC BY-ND 4.0
    https://freiefarbe.de/en/thema-farbe/software/

The Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International terms
apply to that data:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/

CC BY-ND 4.0 permits verbatim redistribution, including commercially,
with attribution; it does not permit distributing modified colour data.
The script installs the files as-is and writes an attribution file
alongside them.

Not downloaded or included, because they are trademarked and cannot be
redistributed: Pantone, RAL, TOYO, DIC, HKS colour books (beyond the
independently measured CIELAB values in OCSC), Focoltone, Trumatch.
